  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "RoomSharp.Cli 0.1.3\n      - Update Dependancies\n      \n      RoomSharp.Cli 0.1.2\n      - New Commands:\n        - migrate:rollback: Roll back migrations (supports --steps, --to, --force)\n        - migrate:timeline: Visual migration history with status\n        - db:stats: Database statistics (size, tables, rows, indexes)\n        - generate:diagram: ERD diagrams in Mermaid/DBML format\n        - make:view: Scaffold DatabaseView entities\n        - make:converter: Scaffold TypeConverter classes\n      - Config Enhancements:\n        - Added views, converters, repositories paths to room.config.json\n      - Bug Fixes:\n        - Fixed MySQL transaction error in rollback operations\n        - Added user-friendly version mismatch detection with actionable solutions",
